 "name_en": "Delivery of Goods on Behalf of Another Company (2UW)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Delivery of Goods on Behalf of Another Company (2UW)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioeb847b4bf34c4c6e9e6762554598368f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb847b4bf34c4c6e9e6762554598368f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this third party process, the seller company (A) uses a third-party vendor (C) to ship the goods sold directly to the customer (B). This process requires at least three Nota Fiscal that are issued in a proper sequence. The first Nota Fiscal (sales) is issued by the seller company to the customer. The second Nota Fiscal (shipment) is issued by the supplier company to the customer. The third Nota Fiscal is issued by the supplier company to the seller company.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb847b4bf34c4c6e9e6762554598368f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage freight cost of sales order</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Review basic credit management</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute picking</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide proof of delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing document</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb847b4bf34c4c6e9e6762554598368f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide third-party sales order processing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>代表其他公司交货 (2UW)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioeb847b4bf34c4c6e9e6762554598368f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb847b4bf34c4c6e9e6762554598368f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此第三方流程中，卖方公司 (A) 使用第三方供应商 (C) 将已售货物直接运送给客户 (B)。此流程至少需要三个以正确顺序开具的 Nota 财政。第一个发票（销售）由卖方公司向客户开具。第二个发票（装运）由供应商公司向客户开具。第三个发票由供应商公司向卖方公司开具。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb847b4bf34c4c6e9e6762554598368f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理销售订单的货运成本</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">检查基本信用管理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行拣配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提供交货证明</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb847b4bf34c4c6e9e6762554598368f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提供第三方销售订单处理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
